#: ../../source/get_started/kinematics.md:1
msgid "From commands to motion"
msgstr "从指令到运动"

#: ../../source/get_started/kinematics.md:3
msgid "Change a velocity command and see how it becomes a trajectory. This lab connects the state and action conventions in [Concepts](../concepts.md) to the differential-drive update used by IR-SIM."
msgstr "改变速度指令，观察它如何形成轨迹。本实验将[核心概念](../concepts.md) 中的状态与动作约定，与 IR-SIM 使用的差速运动学更新联系起来。"

#: ../../source/get_started/kinematics.md:5
msgid "Explore the model"
msgstr "探索模型"

#: ../../source/get_started/kinematics.md:15
msgid "Three experiments"
msgstr "三个小实验"

#: ../../source/get_started/kinematics.md:18
msgid "Set the linear speed to `0`. Position stays fixed while the heading changes: a differential-drive robot can turn in place."
msgstr "将前向速度设为 `0`。位置保持不变，航向持续变化：差速机器人可以原地旋转。"

#: ../../source/get_started/kinematics.md:21
msgid "State, frames, and units"
msgstr "状态、坐标系与单位"

#: ../../source/get_started/kinematics.md:9
msgid "Quantity"
msgstr "物理量"

#: ../../source/get_started/kinematics.md:9
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../source/get_started/kinematics.md:9
msgid "Unit"
msgstr "单位"

